  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let a cylinder of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>, length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;take elementary disc of radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;and trickiness&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>dx</mi></math>&nbsp;at distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;from axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;then moment of inertia about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;as this element</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/de968068-2d76-4a86-9ca1-fb93342a9e87-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 165px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>dl</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>dmR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>dmx</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>dl</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>dmR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac><mi>dx</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>&#960;L</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>dI</mi><mi>dL</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#960;L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>&#960;L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#960;R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>&#960;L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo>